    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-Y6xhQEX4Bfo0WCBeAKiyAEa7T.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>要说嬛嬛是“宫”斗冠军，那“苏妃”槿汐也能称得上是“工”斗冠军，打工的工！</span></p><span></span><p><span>拉呱常驻：9.9级甄学爱好者菜花</span></p><span></span><p><span>特邀嘉宾：9.9级甄学爱好者鱼头</span></p><span></span><p><span>N刷甄嬛传，原来甄学中还教了“职场学问”，今天就和大家一起来讨论一下我们的生存冠军cp苏培盛和崔槿汐~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 角色深剖-&gt;语言大师苏培盛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> 苏培盛的高情商与职场智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 官配CP的夺得“工”斗冠军</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 角色深剖-&gt;风险投资女神崔槿汐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> 原来嬛嬛必出宫还可以这样解读，妙啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 从宫廷斗争看现代职场策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">32:59</a> 宫廷生存策略模拟之我是松芝啦...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a> 宫廷生存策略模拟之我怎么在碎玉轩扫地...</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：菜花同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《红颜劫》---姚贝娜</span></p>]]></description>
