  <item>
    <title>EP20.共生荆棘：友谊是灵魂的创可贴还是玻璃渣？(上)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680a595d8aed253fa356a1ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680a595d8aed253fa356a1ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Apr 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「友性动物」测试题：</span></p><span></span><p><span>说明：共10题，选择最符合你的选项，统计出现最多的字母对应动物类型</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 朋友突然说要带新同事加入聚会，你会？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A. 立刻查对方社交账号并准备话题（🐙）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B. 默默多带个熟人平衡局面（🦥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>C. 直接说“下次再约”（🦨）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D. 兴奋计划三人游戏（🦥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 发现好友和TA的同事用同款手机壳，你？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A. 立刻买更夸张的情侣款（🦨）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B. 假装没看见但减少联系（🦥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>C. 开玩笑问“你们在搞办公室恋情？”（🐙）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D. 研究TA同事的星座血型（🐙）</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 朋友连续三次没回消息却在发朋友圈，你？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A. 疯狂点赞TA所有动态（🦨）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B. 半年后突然发“还活着吗”（🦥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>C. 下次见面时模仿TA语气说话（🐙）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D. 直接拉黑等TA发现（🦨）</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 朋友说“你比对象懂我”，你回应？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A. “建议你换个对象”（🦨）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B. 转移话题聊天气（🦥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>C. “那必须请我吃大餐”（🐙）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D. 截图发共同群聊（🐙）</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 朋友恋爱后的理想相处模式是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A. 每周固定姐妹/兄弟日（🦨）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B. 等TA分手再出现（🦥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>C. 和TA对象处成闺蜜（🐙）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D. 假装吃醋要求补偿（🦨）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 「友性动物」测试——你是哪种类型的朋友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 蜜獾、章鱼和树懒：性格测试及其名人投影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> 神马！友情还分嫡庶！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1059">17:39</a> 不同朋友面前的你是什么样子的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 尽管足够谨慎，但还是在职场被“朋友”背刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> 一份来自追星同担的友情创可贴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a> 卡哇姨的友情坎坷路（o(╥﹏╥)o）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3038">50:38</a> 关于朋友间的占有欲和沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3678">01:01:18</a> 友性嫉妒诊疗室？其实我是大醋包</span></p><span></span><p><span>---别走开，下期更精彩---</span></p><span></span><p><span>拉呱常驻：菜花、卡哇姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>特邀嘉宾：可爱基德--</span><span href=""><span>炔德聊天室</span></span></p><span></span><p><span>幕后剪辑：磨磨唧唧小胡+缓缓慢慢菜花</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：MOONLIGHT--刘宪华</span></p>]]></description>
