  <item>
    <title>EP10.什么？手头有点紧？那这几个兼职快看下...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ba1413db5e6d6bf9c25bf7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ba1413db5e6d6bf9c25bf7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 13:54:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJs-C7CEePjOypFE3rwuql3NyWU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>哈喽哈！本次野草为大家带来一系列关于寻找和从事不同行业兼职的经验和建议，覆盖了快餐业、电影院、火锅店、美妆零售、线上客服、舞蹈教学、家教以及摆摊等多个方面，希望能帮助到正在寻找兼职的大家~</span></p><span></span><p><span>注意：本次录音环境不太好，大家多多包涵！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 野草归来，-起来聊聊兼职吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 兼职体验之你的汉堡是我亲手做的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 兼职体验之带你云逛电影院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> 兼职体验之勇闯火锅店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> 兼职体验之我就是最美的美妆零售员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3257">54:17</a> 兼职体验Z客服! 可服!鸭梨山大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3597">59:57</a> 兼职体验之本舞蹈老师带你旋转跳跃闭着眼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4247">01:10:47</a> 兼职体验之终于过了一把老师的瘾!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4691">01:18:11</a> 兼职体验之摆摊的快乐我知道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5200">01:26:40</a> 嘿勇士!挣钱是一方面!体验生活生另一方面~</span></p><span></span><p><span>--兼职大汇总--</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuYFeVwhOoXaDFbRvu540qvH1-gt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>幕后剪辑：是小胡鸭（主力军）+菜花（打杂备用军）</span></p><span></span><p><span>常驻拉呱：卡哇姨、菜花</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期预告：中元节来临，纳凉特辑如火如荼准备中~</span></p>]]></description>
